{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1539492-robert-downey-jr-as-dr-doom","id":1539492,"title":"Robert Downey Jr as Dr. Doom?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-29T13:01:52-07:00","id":1539492,"title":"Robert Downey Jr as Dr. Doom?","content":"Who is surprised by this casting for one of the top baddies of Marvel Comics and do you strong hopes that this will work or will fans still see him as Tony Stark and I wonder if he is playing Victor Von Doom, but an alternate version of Tony Stark that went bad? Personally I would have gone with Mads Milkasen as Dr. Doom from some the films I seen him in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-29T13:43:54-07:00","id":1539496,"title":"","content":"The problem with him as Tony Stark is that there's almost no actual effort to play the part. He's playing himself.<br /> <br /> I can see Von Doom as a way to prove his acting skills, for better or worse.<br /> <br /> Not much beyond that, though. Unless he pulls it royally well, we won't see Victor in all his villainous glory. And I'm personally tired of Tony Stark being all over the place, if it is another Tony Stark or his shenanigans...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-30T01:28:57-07:00","id":1539522,"title":"","content":"I'm a bit disappointed... I had hoped with Tony Stark's death in Endgame and Robert Downey Jr. getting an Oscar for his role in Oppenheimer, he'd be free to take on more interesting roles. But I guess, after it all fell apart with Jonathan Majors, Disney/Marvel just pressed the panic-button and convinced RDJ to come back. I don't think I even wanna know how much money they have given him to do this...<br /> <br /> As for the role itself, the way I understood the reveal is that they're gonna do the Multiverse-thing where it's a Tony Stark from a universe where he becomes Doctor Doom. I don't remember which Iron Man run it was where they did that but I do vaguely remember that variant being a thing. It was just a more bitter and grim variant of Tony Stark that had a green Iron Man suit from what I can recall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-30T12:54:20-07:00","id":1539550,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking but I hope that I'm wrong is that this version of Dr. Doom will be an evil variant of Iron Man and that sucks as Dr. Doom is my favorite Marvel villian from the company and we haven't seen a good live action version of him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-31T00:58:11-07:00","id":1539578,"title":"","content":"I have doubts about Robert Downy Jr. Dr. Doom is a completely different character from Tony Stark, and I doubt they're going to be able to keep RDJ from doing what he wants. Still, considering how bad Doom has been in the movies so far, I doubt RDJ can do a worse job and than we saw in the Fantastic Four movies. And even if he's a terrible Dr. Doom, he should still be amusing to watch anyway. <br /> <br /> That said, I've only seen three Marvel movies since Endgame - Black Panther and Antman 2 and 3 (and I wish I hadn't spent money on 3). I don't know that I'll bother to see this. Maybe someday when I've got a week or two off of work I'll subscribe to Disney+ for a month and just marathon all of the Marvel movies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-31T14:04:55-07:00","id":1539604,"title":"","content":"To me it looks like a move of desperation as the last batch of marvel films have been lackluster to say the least &amp; not many like the newer characters that came out and let's get someone from the times when things were good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-01T01:49:17-07:00","id":1539626,"title":"","content":"Along with bringing back the Russo Brothers as well... They're really banking on nostalgia.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I think this <a href=\"https://screenrant.com/how-iron-man-become-doctor-doom-comics-infamous/\" target=\"_blank\">Screenrant-article</a> has a good list of all the times in the comics when Doctor Doom and Iron Man were one and the same or swapped places.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-02T09:06:55-07:00","id":1539701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1539492-robert-downey-jr-as-dr-doom?p=1539604#post1539604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To me it looks like a move of desperation as the last batch of marvel films have been lackluster to say the least &amp; not many like the newer characters that came out and let's get someone from the times when things were good.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's definitely a desperation move, and an <i>expensive</i> one. And yet all they really had to do was play the<b> X </b>card as evidenced by Deadpool printing money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-02T09:58:55-07:00","id":1539707,"title":"","content":"I believe that Robert Downey Jr is getting somewhere in the neighborhood of 70-80 million dollars to come back. Good for him to get that type of money \ud83d\udcb8\ud83d\udcb0.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-02T15:59:39-07:00","id":1539724,"title":"","content":"To be fair Monteparnas, RDJ is hardly alone with many of the older actors and actresses just playing themselves now and know that there fanbase will watch them in anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-03T01:59:19-07:00","id":1539741,"title":"","content":"I will only use two memes to draw my a bit of diguss with chooseing RDJ as main villian of MCU. First, he is NOT Romani actor Victor Doom deserves.<br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://scontent-waw2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/453482263_10221626854575561_2867961572466104795_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=bd9a62&amp;_nc_ohc=YtVmV-kazgMQ7kNvgHP3a91&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AYCvRBPEV-xt4dzbqJSHX-PCjTD3TLBieLzZfopsWH7UkA&amp;oe=66B3D0E1\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://scontent-waw2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/453482263_10221626854575561_2867961572466104795_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=bd9a62&amp;_nc_ohc=YtVmV-kazgMQ7kNvgHP3a91&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AYCvRBPEV-xt4dzbqJSHX-PCjTD3TLBieLzZfopsWH7UkA&amp;oe=66B3D0E1\" data-thumb-url=\"https://scontent-waw2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/453482263_10221626854575561_2867961572466104795_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=bd9a62&amp;_nc_ohc=YtVmV-kazgMQ7kNvgHP3a91&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AYCvRBPEV-xt4dzbqJSHX-PCjTD3TLBieLzZfopsWH7UkA&amp;oe=66B3D0E1\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> And with 'resurrection' of RDJ to roles, next MCU phase will look like this. \ud83d\ude02<br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://scontent-waw2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/453534638_469901175959957_5784039088378164862_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p526x296&amp;_nc_cat=103&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=Y6KscM8YhUoQ7kNvgFUhTwC&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AYAn_VTlwj_XPHzud4AZ0Z8_6DwLsjgEqw7-id9ixcDFIA&amp;oe=66B3C421\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://scontent-waw2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/453534638_469901175959957_5784039088378164862_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p526x296&amp;_nc_cat=103&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=Y6KscM8YhUoQ7kNvgFUhTwC&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AYAn_VTlwj_XPHzud4AZ0Z8_6DwLsjgEqw7-id9ixcDFIA&amp;oe=66B3C421\" data-thumb-url=\"https://scontent-waw2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/453534638_469901175959957_5784039088378164862_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p526x296&amp;_nc_cat=103&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=Y6KscM8YhUoQ7kNvgFUhTwC&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AYAn_VTlwj_XPHzud4AZ0Z8_6DwLsjgEqw7-id9ixcDFIA&amp;oe=66B3C421\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-03T09:48:46-07:00","id":1539755,"title":"","content":"Mads Mikkelsen would have been a way better choice for Dr. Doom and some even mentioned Cillian Murphy as a possible choice. But given how poorly portrayed most baddies have been in recent films. I'd be expecting Doom to lose badly to Captain Marvel, Falcon America and what passes for a list Avengers now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T05:59:20-07:00","id":1539789,"title":"","content":"Hiring RDJ for Doom is certainly an interesting move. I guess it's too early to know what exactly they're doing, be it that he's an alternate Tony Stark or actually Victor Von Doom.<br /> <br /> We'll see how it goes.<br /> <br /> Of course, it's an interesting pivot away from Kang as the big villain. I get why they're doing it, but I wonder if they'll even address that Kang got built up, or if they'll quietly drop it and hope no one remembers some of the post credit scenes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T08:52:12-07:00","id":1539792,"title":"","content":"I'm going with Dr. Doom showing up and laying waste to the forces of Kang. Or maybe they will just ignore it and hope that fans don't mention it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-05T14:53:44-07:00","id":1539889,"title":"","content":"Who knows with the success of Deadpool and Wolverine, maybe Disney can get out the creative slump they have been in. I'm just not sure having Robert Downey Jr cast as Dr. Doom is the way as most see him as the perfectly cast Iron Man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T16:20:07-07:00","id":1539956,"title":"","content":"Though I was mostly a DC Comics reader myself. I was a big fan of Iron Man and Bob Layton and David Micheline and later Len Kenminski were my favorite teams on the series and when I heard Robert Downey Jr was cast as Tony Stark.<br /> <br /> That was perfect casting as he knew what it was like to battle with drug and alcohol addictions that Tony had.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T17:32:52-07:00","id":1539962,"title":"","content":"He's the perfect Iron Man, but mostly because he has similar personality and issues.<br /> <br /> But I've never been that much a fan of Tony Stark, and by now I'm fed up with both of them, TS and RDJ.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T20:34:57-07:00","id":1539968,"title":"","content":"Yeah I stopped liking Iron Man during the Civil War and the related stories including the X-Men vs Avengers where we had a version of Captain America being okay with the notion of putting Hope Summers into protective custody on the basis that she could be a danger. <br /> <br /> That didn't strike as something that Steve Rogers would be okay with as he was furious when he learned of the internment camps during WW2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-10T05:06:19-07:00","id":1540127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/ge